    {"_g": "G7b", "rect": [566, 1497, 806, 1724], "fill": null, "text": "Great work on today's interview practice, Mochi! I loved how you tried to explain your strength, UI design, with a specific project. You clearly understood my questions and kept answering right to the end. Next time you get stuck, try saying even a short phrase with confidence. Fillers like \"I mean...\" or \"Let me see...\" buy you time and help you sound smoother. Keep practicing and you'll speak more fluently!", "size": 13, "weight": 500, "align": "left", "box": [566, 1497, 806, 1724], "color": {"darkest": [566, 1497, 806, 1560]}, "valign": "top", "line_height": 1.36},
